<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title></title>
</head>
<body>


<div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; font-style: italic; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">De kennisontwikkeling op dit onderwerp is nog vers, maar onderstaande helpt je sowieso op weg met inzicht in competenties en een schets van verschillende soorten praktijken.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Competenties die je nodig hebt</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Er is nog weinig empirisch onderzoek naar wat deze docentrollen precies vereisen, maar uit recente studies (o.a. Veltman et al., 2022; Oonk et al., 2020; </span><span style="margin: 0px">Flavian</span><span style="margin: 0px">, 2024) komen de volgende competenties naar voren:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><ol role="list" start="1" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Flexibiliteit en aanpassingsvermogen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span></span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><span lang="NL-NL" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Je beweegt mee met onvoorspelbare leerprocessen, verandert van rol als de situatie daarom vraagt, en stemt je aanpak af op diverse leerbehoeften.</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><ol role="list" start="2" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Interdisciplinair begrip en inhoudelijke breedte</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Je hoeft geen expert in alle vakgebieden te zijn, maar kunt wel verbanden leggen tussen disciplines en studenten helpen dat ook te doen.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><ol role="list" start="3" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Bemiddelings- en communicatievaardigheden</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Je onderhoudt relaties met externe partners en creëert een veilige ruimte voor dialoog tussen verschillende perspectieven.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><ol role="list" start="4" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Coachend begeleiden van studenten</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Je ondersteunt studenten bij het ontwikkelen van transdisciplinaire competenties zoals kritisch denken, samenwerking en zelfreflectie.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><ol role="list" start="5" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Leergierigheid en professionele ontwikkeling</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Je ontwikkelt jezelf continu en staat open voor nieuwe vormen van onderwijs en feedback uit de praktijk.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><ol role="list" start="6" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px"><li aria-setsize="-1" role="listitem" style="margin: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">Omgaan met spanningen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Je helpt studenten (en jezelf) omgaan met onzekerheid, ambiguïteit en spanningen die ontstaan bij het samen leren over complexe problemen.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px;"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></p></li></ol></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px;">Deze competenties vragen tijd om te ontwikkelen en </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px;">onderstrepen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> het belang van professionele ruimte en ondersteuning binnen het team en de organisatie. Niet elke docent voelt zich meteen thuis in deze rol – het is belangrijk hier open over te zijn en hierin samen te leren.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p lang="EN-US" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px"></span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p lang="EN-US" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="NL-NL" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;">Bronnen:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Flavian, H. (2024). Transdisciplinary Teaching: Main Concepts and Perspectives. In Transdisciplinary Teaching in Inclusive Schools: Promoting Transdisciplinary Education for Learners with Special Needs (</span><span style="margin: 0px">pp</span><span style="margin: 0px">. 1-15). Cham: Springer International Publishing.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Oonk, C., Gulikers, J. T., den Brok, P. J., Wesselink, R., Beers, P. J., &amp; Mulder, M. (2020). Teachers as brokers: adding a university-society perspective to higher education teacher competence profiles. Higher Education, 80(4), 701-718/</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">Veltman, M., Van Keulen, J., &amp; Voogt, J. (2022): Teacher strategies that foster students’ </span><span style="margin: 0px">boundarycrossing</span><span style="margin: 0px"> </span><span style="margin: 0px">expertise</span><span style="margin: 0px"> when addressing problems with wicked tendencies, Journal of Vocational Education &amp; Training.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 22.0083px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body>
</html>